# Raw and cleaned trip data: 4.5 GB of parquet, far past anything git should hold.
# README.md says where to download it and which scripts rebuild the cleaned files.
#
# The one exception is the zone lookup: 18 KB, and app/main.py reads it at start-up,
# so a fresh clone cannot boot without it. Git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, which is why these ignore directory *contents* step by step
# rather than the directories themselves.
DataSets/*
!DataSets/Zones/
DataSets/Zones/*
!DataSets/Zones/nyc_zones (cleaned).csv

# Virtual environment — rebuild it from requirements.txt
.venv/
venv/

# Editor state, not part of the project
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Logs and scratch output
*.log
